### get all books
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### create book
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "A Court of Silver Flames",
  "author": "Sarah J. Maas"
}

### get book by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/3

### search by title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search/title?title=storm

### search by author
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/search/author?author=sanderson

### get genres
GET http://localhost:8080/api/genres


